(7639157, 1239899, 123833, '<td valign="top">The sunscreen is not only harmful to humans but also to fish and water plants. There are now big signs on the beaches of Lake Geneva asking to remove the sunscreen before going for a swim as the pollution from the chemicals used in sunscreen are already killing the fish. The message about skin cancer has gone too far or at least the sunscreen is not the best solution. It also stuffs up vitamin D production.<br/> <br/>Congrats on TT.</td>', 'The sunscreen is not only harmful to humans but also to fish and water plants. There are now big signs on the beaches of Lake Geneva asking to remove the sunscreen before going for a swim as the pollution from the chemicals used in sunscreen are already killing the fish. The message about skin cancer has gone too far or at least the sunscreen is not the best solution. It also stuffs up vitamin D production. Congrats on TT.', '2019-08-23 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
