(7639251, 1239607, 60581, '<td valign="top"><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1388662" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">I have details here </a></td>', 'I have details here ', '2019-08-23 16:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639252, 1239454, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> How in the WORLD did you take this shot of yourself, in Minimal, in motion, in focus?<br/> <br/>You are my hero, Cory! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not too hard really, just told a fellow rider I was shooting pics of to hold my giant camera in his lap as he was sitting cross legged on the ground, and asked him to keep it pointed in this particular direction, and to simply hold down the button as I was in sight.<br/> <br/>The fact is that with the 400 f/2.8mm and the 1D series bodies, the AF is just so darn good it''s incredible, and the super fast shutter speed helps to nail every shot too.  I did forget to tell him that his ONE JOB was to keep the horizon level like a good meat-tripod, but.. Oh well, it makes the shot more... dynamic.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: How in the WORLD did you take this shot of yourself, in Minimal, in motion, in focus? You are my hero, Cory!   Not too hard really, just told a fellow rider I was shooting pics of to hold my giant camera in his lap as he was sitting cross legged on the ground, and asked him to keep it pointed in this particular direction, and to simply hold down the button as I was in sight. The fact is that with the 400 f/2.8mm and the 1D series bodies, the AF is just so darn good it''s incredible, and the super fast shutter speed helps to nail every shot too.  I did forget to tell him that his ONE JOB was to keep the horizon level like a good meat-tripod, but.. Oh well, it makes the shot more... dynamic. ', '2019-08-23 16:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639253, 1239923, 112828, '<td valign="top">This is ridiculously adorable for some reason, like a cartoon of the kindest lady ever.  Incredible!</td>', 'This is ridiculously adorable for some reason, like a cartoon of the kindest lady ever.  Incredible!', '2019-08-23 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639261, 1239923, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> You are brave, very brave. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It is a subtle difference, but I think fearless more apt.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: You are brave, very brave.  It is a subtle difference, but I think fearless more apt.', '2019-08-23 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
