(7639283, 1239923, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations Lydia for such a brilliant photo so full of personality and fun .. <br/>you do it like no other .. :)<br/>oh . forgot to say .. so good you got the blue for this .. totally wonderful .. :)</td>', 'many congratulations Lydia for such a brilliant photo so full of personality and fun .. you do it like no other .. :)oh . forgot to say .. so good you got the blue for this .. totally wonderful .. :)', '2019-08-24 00:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
