(7639286, 1239906, 67145, '<td valign="top">Mary Ann .. this is wonderful .. and i''m loving the pisces theme .. <br/>i may have my sun in aries but my ascendant is pisces .. so i have a lot of pisces in my personality .. <br/>we would probably get on .. !! .. or understand each other at least .. ;)<br/>many congratulations on your hm and a brilliant photo .. <br/>i''m in awe of ppl who can take self portraits like this .. just fantastic .. :)<br/></td>', 'Mary Ann .. this is wonderful .. and i''m loving the pisces theme .. i may have my sun in aries but my ascendant is pisces .. so i have a lot of pisces in my personality .. we would probably get on .. !! .. or understand each other at least .. ;)many congratulations on your hm and a brilliant photo .. i''m in awe of ppl who can take self portraits like this .. just fantastic .. :)', '2019-08-24 00:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639287, 1239454, 67145, '<td valign="top">congratulations Cory on the hm .. and of course a brilliant photo .. that dof is out of this world .. <br/>love the energy and your smile .. this looks like one of your passions .. thinking photography might be one too .. !! .. ;)<br/>very cool .. :)<br/></td>', 'congratulations Cory on the hm .. and of course a brilliant photo .. that dof is out of this world .. love the energy and your smile .. this looks like one of your passions .. thinking photography might be one too .. !! .. ;)very cool .. :)', '2019-08-24 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639288, 1239779, 67145, '<td valign="top">congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. <br/>and how cool to see the woman behind the camera .. <br/>this is a beautiful image Anita .. very lovely .. :)</td>', 'congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. and how cool to see the woman behind the camera .. this is a beautiful image Anita .. very lovely .. :)', '2019-08-24 01:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639289, 1239936, 67145, '<td valign="top">congratulations Tom on great place in quite a competitive challenge .. <br/>loving the black and white .. <br/>cataract surgery is like giving some of your life back .. well it was for me .. <br/>had to look thru the viewfinder with my glasses on .. <br/>focusing was a nightmare .. <br/>you wont know yourself  .. <br/>well .. maybe you will .. but i feel the version after cataract surgery will be much easier on the eyes .. haha .., i think that may have been a ''dad'' joke .. definitely very lame .. hope you got a grin .. :)</td>', 'congratulations Tom on great place in quite a competitive challenge .. loving the black and white .. cataract surgery is like giving some of your life back .. well it was for me .. had to look thru the viewfinder with my glasses on .. focusing was a nightmare .. you wont know yourself  .. well .. maybe you will .. but i feel the version after cataract surgery will be much easier on the eyes .. haha .., i think that may have been a ''dad'' joke .. definitely very lame .. hope you got a grin .. :)', '2019-08-24 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7639290, 1239899, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''ve just read the myriad of comments you have received for this photo .. just by the comments you should have got the blue .. however .. the blue would have been very hard to beat .. <br/> <br/>i love that you consistently come out with such imaginative takes on the challenges .. <br/>wish there was a pill for that .. JOKE .!!. <br/>would probably turn out harmful  .. in some random unexpected way .. <br/> <br/>and i''ve been thinking for some time that sunscreen could be just another thing that is supposedly good but turns out bad .. my thinking is that most things that are ''artificial'' turn out to be a bit dangerous for us humans .. and every other lifeform on the planet .. <br/>anyway .. i got a bit carried away there . <br/> <br/>what i actually came here to say was .. <br/>THIS IS FANTASTIC .. altho quite weird .. like ppl have said .. <br/>and almost difficult to look at ... like you have some terrible disfiguring skin condition .. should i delete that bit .. you never know when you could offend someone unintentionally .. i feel political correctness has totally lost the plot .. :)<br/></td>', 'i''ve just read the myriad of comments you have received for this photo .. just by the comments you should have got the blue .. however .. the blue would have been very hard to beat ..  i love that you consistently come out with such imaginative takes on the challenges .. wish there was a pill for that .. JOKE .!!. would probably turn out harmful  .. in some random unexpected way ..  and i''ve been thinking for some time that sunscreen could be just another thing that is supposedly good but turns out bad .. my thinking is that most things that are ''artificial'' turn out to be a bit dangerous for us humans .. and every other lifeform on the planet .. anyway .. i got a bit carried away there .  what i actually came here to say was .. THIS IS FANTASTIC .. altho quite weird .. like ppl have said .. and almost difficult to look at ... like you have some terrible disfiguring skin condition .. should i delete that bit .. you never know when you could offend someone unintentionally .. i feel political correctness has totally lost the plot .. :)', '2019-08-24 01:17:17.000000', NULL, 0);
